          <base:Paragraph>It checks the pipetting precision and accuracy of the sample pipettor A.</base:Paragraph>
          <base:Paragraph>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</base:Paragraph>
          <base:Paragraph>Preconditions:</base:Paragraph>
          <base:Paragraph>- Perform the sample transfer head pipetting intro</base:Paragraph>
